196	     * LVGL and owns the display + event loop.  We only create our UI
197	     * widgets on the existing LVGL instance. */
198	
199	    /* Do NOT create a display or allocate a display buffer — the system
200	     * already has one.  Creating a second display causes resource
201	     * conflicts and framebuffer contention. */
202	
